PC PC_Timer @ Timer
   process Timer (t) @ OpIf3378007b
   operator OpIf3378007b.If
   op_connector_g OpIf3378007b->Op49419096{t≥0}
   op_else_connector OpIf3378007b->Stop202ab08b
   operator Op49419096.Choice
   op_connector Op49419096->tock
   op_connector Op49419096->timeout
   after tock->RefTimer60fa176d
   atom :'tock' {t > 0}  
   atom :'timeout' {t = 0}  
   stop Stop202ab08b
   reference RefTimer60fa176d 
   ref_connector RefTimer60fa176d->Timer ('t-1')